      {
        "start": 57.548,
        "end": 58.415,
        "text": "Then months."
      },
      {
        "start": 58.645,
        "end": 62.55,
        "text": "And the card ends up forgotten in a drawer."
      },
      {
        "start": 63.45,
        "end": 66.058,
        "text": "Now multiply that by millions of customers."
      },
      {
        "start": 66.288,
        "end": 67.778,
        "text": "Some spend every cent."
      },
      {
        "start": 68.008,
        "end": 70.615,
        "text": "Others leave a dollar or two behind."
      },
      {
        "start": 70.845,
        "end": 77.55,
        "text": "Starbucks studies historical redemption patterns to estimate how much of that money customers are unlikely to ever use."
      },
      {
        "start": 78.45,
